[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4255947373","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118606#issuecomment-4255947373","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118606","id":4255947373,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc79rJpt","user":{"login":"Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782","html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-15T22:09:55Z","updated_at":"2026-04-15T22:09:55Z","body":"Is `GODOT_CUSTOM_JOY_MAPPING_DISABLED` there to ignore this file?\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/core/input/godotcontrollerdb.txt\r\n\r\nand also the `gamecontrollerdb.txt`?\r\n\r\n-------\r\n\r\nIf so, then my suggestion would be to remove the \"Windows\" entry and add comments (that Windows, Linux, macOS, and iOS are ignored).\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/core/input/godotcontrollerdb.txt#L1-L10\r\n\r\n\r\nIf possible, if `GODOT_CUSTOM_JOY_MAPPING_DISABLED` is defined, do not generate any file here to speed up the build process.\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/core/input/SCsub\r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4255947373/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4257381541","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118606#issuecomment-4257381541","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118606","id":4257381541,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc79wnyl","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-16T04:26:03Z","updated_at":"2026-04-16T04:26:03Z","body":"> Is `GODOT_CUSTOM_JOY_MAPPING_DISABLED` there to ignore this file? https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/core/input/godotcontrollerdb.txt\r\n> \r\n> and also the `gamecontrollerdb.txt`?\r\n> \r\n> If so, then my suggestion would be to remove the \"Windows\" entry and add comments (that Windows, Linux, macOS, and iOS are ignored). https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/core/input/godotcontrollerdb.txt#L1-L10\r\n> \r\n> If possible, if `GODOT_CUSTOM_JOY_MAPPING_DISABLED` is defined, do not generate any file here to speed up the build process. https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/core/input/SCsub\r\n\r\nNot exactly. 😅 \r\n`GODOT_CUSTOM_JOY_MAPPING_DISABLED` is here to remove older Godot code for joypad mappings before we introduced SDL, but after we did we haven't yet removed the old code.\r\n`godotcontrollerdb.txt` and `gamecontrollerdb.txt` should still be used for all Godot platforms!","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4257381541/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4865313227","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118606#issuecomment-4865313227","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118606","id":4865313227,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIf7Jyw","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-02T11:44:26Z","updated_at":"2026-07-02T11:44:26Z","body":"Also, we may want to remove the mapping creation functionality from the joypads demo, since in Godot hats are converted to d-pad buttons, so a mapping created for a controller with a hat may be invalid.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4865313227/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4866954396","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118606#issuecomment-4866954396","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118606","id":4866954396,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIhfUnA","user":{"login":"Nintorch","id":92302738,"node_id":"U_kgDOBYBtkg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92302738?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch","html_url":"https://github.com/Nintorch","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nintorch/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-02T14:39:16Z","updated_at":"2026-07-02T14:41:06Z","body":"This PR now modifies the way `add_joy_mapping` works, now `p_update_existing` parameter is ignored and always treated as being `true`, since SDL doesn't allow to add a new mapping of a connected controller (with an existing mapping) without it being remapped. This change was done to all platforms, even the ones currently without SDL support, because the behavior across different platforms should be as consistent as possible.\r\nI'm not sure whether we should change the way SDL works in this regard (and it would most likely be hard to change anyway) ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4866954396/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]